Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:44.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-女士  -丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ma'am? - Hi, Lizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫我下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me to come down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:56.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想见你  因为我要和瑞克出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to see you because I'm going on a run with Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.70,0:01:07.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得达里尔死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think Daryl's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:08.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.33,0:01:11.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他得去很远的地方取药\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had to go far away to get the medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以需要些时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it's gonna take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.67,0:01:19.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们失去了D区所有的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost all our food in cell block D,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们要去找些食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we're gonna go look for more
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.00,0:01:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和别的有用的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and whatever else we can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在还没人死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's died yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.95,0:01:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得很多人都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think a lot of people are going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.48,0:01:36.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what always happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.05,0:01:38.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我很难过  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes me sad, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.57,0:01:41.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少他们能复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least they get to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.29,0:01:43.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹  他们复生时  他们不是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzy, when they come back, they aren't--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来的自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}people aren't who they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.40,0:01:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但他们还存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but they're something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.41,0:01:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.41,0:01:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在很小\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm little now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.95,0:01:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不死  就会长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't die, I'll get big.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:02:00.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是我  但我也会不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be me, but I'll be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:02.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都不会和原来一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all don't get to stay the same way we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:24.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹  这更为复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzy, it's more complicated--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:27.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说我很软弱  我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I was weak. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.03,0:02:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很坚强  所以我告诉你我的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm strong, so I'm telling you what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你记得遇到危险时  我教你怎么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember what I told you to do when there's danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.09,0:02:44.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撒丫子就跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run as fast as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.82,0:02:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑到安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You run and run until you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你或你妹妹命悬一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it's your life or your sister's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.97,0:02:55.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能害怕杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't be afraid to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:02:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:02:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:03.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很坚强  丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are strong, Lizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.13,0:03:06.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会活下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna live.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:10.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  你妹妹和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, your sister, and me--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.39,0:03:13.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会活下去  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna survive, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.56,0:03:16.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的匕首呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把T恤塞到匕首后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your T-shirt behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:23.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须能快速拔刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta be able to get to it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:25.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  妈妈  我是说女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mom. I mean ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.07,0:03:26.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别叫我"妈妈"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call me "Mom."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是口误\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:32.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.39,0:03:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:43.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不怕杀行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.86,0:03:46.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是内心很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何做到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:53.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去攻克它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:56.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战胜它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:03:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后某天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:06.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you just change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.16,0:04:12.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会变 \N{\fnArial\fs30}We all change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:05:00.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.97,0:05:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这条是特纳溪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Turner Creek,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:13.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺着下游走几英里就到巴恩斯维尔镇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so Barnesville must be a few miles downstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.25,0:05:15.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,运气好还可以搞辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like our best chance at finding a new ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  泰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Ty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:22.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点跟上  赶路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go. Vonos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.75,0:05:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.30,0:05:35.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.54,0:05:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再往南走几英里就有小镇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There should be a town a few miles south.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:40.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们浪费了一整晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost a whole night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.15,0:05:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妹妹和其他人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister, everybody else--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:52.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续走总有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it helps to keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:56.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:23.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬本来想跟来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie wanted to come, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.56,0:06:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总得有人留守  照顾大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone had to stay back, watch over things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:30.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是指让你信任的人留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone you trust, you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:40.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们本来也会被自己的血液呛死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would have drowned in their own blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.66,0:06:42.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们备受煎熬  我解脱了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were suffering. I made it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.81,0:06:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得处理掉尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needed the bodies gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.95,0:06:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防止病毒扩散\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needed to stop it from spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:53.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是当时唯一被感染的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were the only ones who were sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.11,0:06:55.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活着就是隐患\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:06:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这么做是为了救大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:01.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我迫不得已  总有人得站出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to try. Somebody had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.57,0:07:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是碧石吗  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that jasper?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:29.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成色不错  很衬你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good color. Brings out your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.13,0:07:36.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理查德小姐在A区  我们走的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Miss Richards went into A block, we were leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:38.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她让我帮她留意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asked me to keep a lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.57,0:07:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打算用这个给她爸爸做墓牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna use it for her old man's marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.45,0:07:44.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监狱的人你都认识吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know all them back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里一待就是几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay in one place more than a couple hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.25,0:07:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能记住的东西连自己也佩服\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd be surprised what you pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:22.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(抱歉  车很脏)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.61,0:08:27.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他们会回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think they're coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.47,0:08:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挡风玻璃很干净  被擦过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Windshield's clean, wiped down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停在这里不会超过一天  可能两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't have been here more than a day, maybe two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:35.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说达里尔和其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean Daryl and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:36.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们此行是以防万一  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.64,0:08:37.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防他们回不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case they don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他们回来前  我们先这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until they do. That's what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搜索药柜  急救箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medicine cabinets, first aid kits--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何能够帮到赫谢尔的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything that could help Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们速战速决\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get in, we get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能吃的东西都带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we can eat it, we take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.09,0:08:59.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(无铅柴油)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.90,0:09:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看见什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.03,0:09:22.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不清楚  可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:40.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得找一块新电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta find us a new battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面有些朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got some friends inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.71,0:09:52.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:57.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们清出一条路  看看有多少行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's clear a path, see how many we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, go easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.95,0:10:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不清楚里面的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what we're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:03.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.75,0:11:05.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰  放开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ty, let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.47,0:11:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不放开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell didn't you let go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.43,0:12:35.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.91,0:13:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa. It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.45,0:13:07.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're-- we're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:10.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有水果\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有杏  桃子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we got apricots, peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给  接着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者  别接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, you know, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么弄的  -转角处有个温室\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd this happen? - Greenhouse around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.53,0:13:36.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想找个地方住一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were looking for a place to crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:37.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温室房顶坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The roof's broken now and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:39.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直被雨水滋润  所以全是水果\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's been getting rain, so it's full of fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:40.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在那里待了一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were there about a day
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.81,0:13:42.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后嗜皮者出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the skin-eaters showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.31,0:13:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很扫兴  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killjoys, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.85,0:13:45.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们毁了这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackin' it up for the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.75,0:13:48.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前我还觉得所有人都是混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought everybody was an asshole before this all went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.11,0:13:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我喜欢人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I love people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活着的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know-- people who are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:54.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么受伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们从门口进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they were coming in through the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:13:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我往外爬的时候绊倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tripped crawling out the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.29,0:14:01.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把玻璃拔出来了  但是我的肩膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulled the glass out, but my shoulder--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.66,0:14:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是疼得要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}it still hurts like a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:05.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脱臼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dislocated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能弄好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.45,0:14:10.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来  躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, lay on your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:19.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  往边上挪一挪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, scooch over to the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:21.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抬起手臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold your arm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住这个袋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab ahold of this bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.02,0:14:25.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.34,0:14:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-坚持住  -不行了  好疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And keep holding on. - No, that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.19,0:14:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.75,0:14:32.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到  我不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.92,0:14:33.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:46.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.76,0:14:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还会酸痛几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be sore for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.21,0:15:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开了温室之后  你们就来这儿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the greenhouse, you came here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.29,0:15:02.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我们以为这儿挺安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We thought it was clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没发现那些穿着睡衣的活死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We missed the deadie in the PJs,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.57,0:15:06.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不得已冲进了卫生间躲着\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we dove into the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那在我们来之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how long were you up there
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在里面躲了多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}till we showed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.51,0:15:09.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概两天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.47,0:15:12.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿只有一个行尸  你们还有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was just one. You had guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只剩大约十二发子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have about 12 bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们一般得开五六枪才能放到一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It usually take us about five or six to bring one of them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.45,0:15:19.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你们有刀子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.21,0:15:21.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那要怎样  一刀扎进脑子里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what, stab it in the head?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.47,0:15:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:24.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大约一周前我们和伙伴们分散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got separated from our crew about a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.95,0:15:27.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为只剩我们俩了  所以我们一直小心翼翼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been trying to play it safe since it's just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.77,0:15:29.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我的腿伤了  所以必须谨慎  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to with my leg. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们当时住在一个难民营\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were at a refugee center together
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.92,0:15:33.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果那儿起火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there was a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.37,0:15:35.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们从我身上踏了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}People were just trampling over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.01,0:15:36.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是群混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆救了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:40.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之前并不认识彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't know each other before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.03,0:15:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我的腿没治好  但也算伤愈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't heal right, but it healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.87,0:15:44.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们找到了彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we found each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.67,0:15:46.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受伤也值得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:48.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来你俩要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you two headed next?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会不停地换地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.31,0:15:52.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会等到一个地方待不下去了才走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't been waiting for places to go bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  那已经行不通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's getting a little old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:15:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看起来还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys look all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:58.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的落脚地什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your setup like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗜皮者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The "Skin-eaters"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们叫它们行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call them walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.05,0:16:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.05,0:16:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们杀过多少行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many have you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:11.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(欢迎来到乔治亚州  生人勿扰)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.21,0:16:22.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.99,0:16:49.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电池看起来挺干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, cells look pretty dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,补点蒸馏水就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little distilled water will clear that right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该放手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得好像你很懂似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell you know about it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.85,0:17:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你他妈是专家吗  -不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You the damn expert? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.91,0:17:07.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不想看你送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't want to see you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.98,0:17:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的目的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you're trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:13.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道自己在干什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even know what you're trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.07,0:17:17.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你很恼火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有理由愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have every reason to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.05,0:17:24.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愤怒只会让你变得愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But anger makes you stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.62,0:17:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而愚蠢会害死你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid gets you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:32.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你难道不是还对总督愤怒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you still angry about the Governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.31,0:17:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对他的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:35.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他现在在这儿的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he was here right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.14,0:17:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把他砍成两截\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd cut him in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause that's how it needs to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.95,0:17:44.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.35,0:17:48.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:52.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么还要出去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are you still going out looking for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.36,0:18:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(防冻冷却液)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:23.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些蔓藤里的傻瓜是自杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those douchebags in the vines took themselves out,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:25.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手拉着手\N{\fnArial\fs30}holding hands--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.19,0:18:27.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高唱圣歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}kumbaya style.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们希望死后跟生前一样相聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted to go out together same as they lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.83,0:18:31.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算傻么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That make them douchebags?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.43,0:18:33.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算  他们本能逃生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does if they could have gotten out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:36.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都会努力求生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody makes it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.53,0:18:37.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到他们撑不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}till they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:41.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今人们就像多米诺骨牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}People nowadays are dominoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.11,0:18:44.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也许只是不想看着同伴倒下\N{\fnArial\fs30}What they did, maybe it's about not having to watch them fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:47.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.41,0:18:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该拿的差不多都拿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got about all we're gonna get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:40.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.03,0:19:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们通过你的测试了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, did we pass your test?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.49,0:19:52.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在向北八英里的一座监狱扎营\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a prison eight miles north.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们跟我们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you come back with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.39,0:19:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们无法保证你们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't guarantee your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们那里爆发了一种流感\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an illness, a flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.24,0:19:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况非常糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.61,0:20:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经失去了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.02,0:20:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还有孩子  -你们俩的孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kids, too. - Yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.81,0:20:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.86,0:20:10.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我有一个姑娘被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one of my girls, she's got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.15,0:20:12.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-很抱歉  -她很坚强  会挺过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - She's strong. She'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:16.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有护栏和围墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got fences and walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.53,0:20:17.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们愿意加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.28,0:20:18.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  让我们做什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, whatever you need us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:20.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  你们就在这待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now, sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:23.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天黑前我们会回来接你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of us will circle back for you before dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.66,0:20:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者你们可以帮忙搜索一下周围的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you could help us sweep the rest of this neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:28.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题  我可以去看看温室\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do that. I can check the greenhouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.01,0:20:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果没什么情况  我就多摘点水果\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if it's clear, bring back more fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:31.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也可以去搜索一些房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can hit some of the houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:32.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们愿意帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's nice of you to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.85,0:20:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你的肩膀还\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your shoulder's barely--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.64,0:20:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我这边胳膊不用力就没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I don't put too much weight on this arm, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:39.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我还能走得挺快  -我不觉得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I can still move pretty fast. - I just don't think--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.52,0:20:41.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会冒险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't take any chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会仔细观察  时机合适就动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll look. And if it's cake, we'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:47.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是不合适  我们就撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, we'll just roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己看起来也不太好呢  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you don't look so good yourself, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.08,0:20:52.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你惯用右手还是左手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a righty or a lefty?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.87,0:20:55.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这能扩大我们的搜索范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll cover more ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:20:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们更早回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner we get back...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:20:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没法守着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't carry us, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:03.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那样行不通  -拜托  我们想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It doesn't work that way. - Please, we want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.86,0:21:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你们鸣枪  我们立刻就赶回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fire a shot, we'll come running.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.14,0:21:18.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们两小时后还在这里碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's meet back here in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.54,0:21:26.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会需要这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从没提起过以前所在的队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never told us about the group you were with before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.46,0:21:36.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪一队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你说  你在路上碰到我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when you found me out on that road,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我差一点就走开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost kept walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:48.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.84,0:21:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我看够了一幕幕惨剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I was done being a witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前后两次  跟两支不同的队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two times, two different groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.92,0:21:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都是唯一的幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the last one standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.26,0:22:02.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像我就必须一次次见证这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I was supposed to see it happen over and over,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像诅咒一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like it's some kind of curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.28,0:22:12.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你一个人在寂静的世界生存...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, when it's just you out there with the quiet...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.68,0:22:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上只有喝上一瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}used to be I'd drink a bottle of anything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.30,0:22:19.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才能闭眼昏睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}just so I could shut my eyes at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:23.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为在监狱里  有人群陪伴会容易些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured the prison, the people, thought it'd be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.93,0:22:27.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那次去基地搜索  我纯粹是为了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}The run to the Big Spot, I did it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.07,0:22:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总得要有点事干\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta keep busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.83,0:22:33.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我去是为了弄瓶酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I did it so I could get me a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.19,0:22:35.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么酒都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.16,0:22:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把酒拿起来  握在手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I picked it up, I held it in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.90,0:22:40.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但最终我又放下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.54,0:22:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放下酒瓶时太用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put it down so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.88,0:22:43.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个房顶都跟着塌了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}it took the whole damn shelf with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.52,0:22:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才引来了行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what brought on the walkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.45,0:22:47.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以扎克才会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's what got Zack killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.86,0:22:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞎扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.63,0:23:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你进车里试试发动引擎吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you get in there and try the engine?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.38,0:23:03.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是一根红色和绿色的电线\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a red and a green wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.43,0:23:05.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去  又不是什么高科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. It ain't rocket science.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.28,0:23:13.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,踩点油门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it some gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.15,0:23:36.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙和我选了那个基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha and me picked that spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.76,0:23:38.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他带你一起去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took you with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.54,0:23:40.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人能预见到那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't no way anybody could've known.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.66,0:23:43.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不再是独自一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't gonna be standing alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.88,0:23:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也不会  咱们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}not no more. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.67,0:24:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起码都过期了一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all expired by at least a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.19,0:24:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是拿着吧  让赫谢尔决定他要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better to take it. Let Herschel decide what he needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.73,0:24:14.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这样做对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think it was right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.64,0:24:16.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让那些孩子跟我们一起回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letting those kids come back with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.72,0:24:19.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样做才人道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it was the humane thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.65,0:24:21.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你觉得这样对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But did you think it was right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.11,0:24:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:31.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,翻箱倒柜  希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Digging through drawers, hoping that...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.25,0:24:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借着一些止咳糖和消毒剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}a couple of cough drops and some disinfectant might be the difference
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.32,0:24:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人多活几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}between dying and living a couple of more hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.73,0:24:40.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们能帮我们渡过难关\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're strong enough to help us survive this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.65,0:24:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么没错  我认为你的决定是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, I think you made the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.19,0:24:44.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不行呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.76,0:24:46.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望他们能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.41,0:24:50.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.44,0:24:54.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.68,0:25:01.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了两个人  可你只字不提\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed two people and you haven't said a word about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.55,0:25:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想让我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.76,0:25:06.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重点不是你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.59,0:25:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是要去面对现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about facing reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.19,0:25:11.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实总是来势汹汹  而一次又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It always comes for us and over and over again
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.46,0:25:12.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们唯有面对现实  才得以生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}we face it so that we can live.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.86,0:25:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这只是为了我们能生存  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So that we can live. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.33,0:25:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,归根结底就是这一目标而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it always comes down to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.78,0:25:19.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以当农民  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be a farmer, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.31,0:25:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不能只是个农民\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just be a farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.49,0:25:32.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是位出色的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.55,0:25:36.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比我想象的还要出色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than I probably gave you credit for.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.01,0:25:40.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没杀过两个自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never murdered two of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.17,0:25:41.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.69,0:25:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.49,0:25:48.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So were they.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.54,0:25:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会把我们所有人都杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were gonna kill all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.49,0:25:52.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这你没法知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.73,0:25:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你认为这样能救朱迪思或卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you thought it would save Judith or Carl,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.85,0:25:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会这样做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you have done it then
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.71,0:26:01.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是回去种庄稼\N{\fnArial\fs30}or would you have just gone back to your crops
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.19,0:26:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望一切都会没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hoped it'd all be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.17,0:26:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没必要喜欢我的所作所为  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to like what I did, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.50,0:26:08.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.40,0:26:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要接受就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.75,0:26:25.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来我们快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.23,0:26:27.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要找的楼房就在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The building we want is just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.57,0:26:36.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(学习资料中心)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.95,0:26:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.75,0:26:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  咱们速战速决\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's make this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.04,0:26:47.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.76,0:26:49.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.78,0:26:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.39,0:27:18.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去街对面的房子看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hit the houses across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.30,0:27:20.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.72,0:27:28.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会治肩膀脱臼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you put his shoulder back before?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.47,0:27:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟赫谢尔学的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You learn that from Herschel?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.62,0:27:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,网上学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.49,0:27:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样总比骗急诊护士说我第三次从楼梯上跌落好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easier than telling an ER nurse I'd fallen down the stairs a third time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.96,0:27:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.57,0:27:42.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  自己动手丰衣足食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be. Just fixed what needed fixin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.20,0:27:49.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我其实还说服过自己  和他一起生活是快乐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually convinced myself I was happy with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.67,0:27:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想到至少不是孤苦伶仃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which wasn't all that hard to do
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.96,0:27:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事也就显得没那么困难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering my idea of happiness then was just not being alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.56,0:27:57.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起码能过个像样的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made a decent living.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.45,0:28:00.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有心的时候  还是很有魅力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was charming when he wanted to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.72,0:28:04.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是那些他酩酊大醉后醒来的早上  他会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially those mornings after he'd come home piss-drunk and...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.85,0:28:10.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我太傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.42,0:28:12.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.29,0:28:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时我觉得自己无法坚强起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think I could be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.64,0:28:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉完全做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.39,0:28:22.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我现在做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already was.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.30,0:28:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么都不说她的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you say her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.06,0:28:32.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她已经死了  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.43,0:28:34.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.19,0:28:36.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.90,0:28:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已成昨日之梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody else's slideshow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.97,0:28:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时早晨醒来我会期望洛莉还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some mornings I still wake up half-expecting Lori to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.39,0:28:56.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提醒我去接卡尔放学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reminding me to pick up Carl after school
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.84,0:28:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫我准备吃早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}or telling me breakfast is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.70,0:29:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每周日她都会给我们做烤薄饼  简直...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every Sunday she'd make us these pancakes that were just...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.99,0:29:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难吃到要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}godawful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.47,0:29:13.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面粉和得也不对劲儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clumps of flour that weren't mixed in right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.15,0:29:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing was...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.38,0:29:18.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她自己也知道难吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}she knew it was bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.52,0:29:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那她为什么还做啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd she keep at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.30,0:29:24.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.03,0:29:26.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望跟别人家一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}she wanted us to be the kind of family
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.82,0:29:28.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,周末吃顿薄煎饼才像一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that ate pancakes on Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.77,0:30:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.50,0:30:16.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆应该在等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam is probably waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.87,0:30:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有叫“西林”或者“林”的药  通通都拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything ending with "cillin" or "cin", C-I-N, grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.15,0:30:34.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把药溶进点滴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll dissolve the pills in the IVs,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.16,0:30:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接静脉注射\N{\fnArial\fs30}put 'em right into the bloodstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.84,0:30:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剂量不太好定  但是考虑到拖延的时间太长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dosage will be tricky but considering the time we lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.80,0:30:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么样  \N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.59,0:30:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,输液袋  输液管  夹子  连接头都有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bags, tubes, clamps, connectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.66,0:30:48.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-单子上的都有了  -你们这边呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything on the list. - What about y'all?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.88,0:30:50.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we got it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.14,0:30:51.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.68,0:30:54.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.77,0:31:23.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.57,0:31:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.83,0:31:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门坏了关不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Door's busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.84,0:31:45.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挡住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.14,0:32:00.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.65,0:32:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.47,0:32:28.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有多少  -看不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many? - I can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.71,0:32:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们可以干掉它们  -不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can take 'em. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.24,0:32:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们被感染了  和监狱里一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're infected. Same as at the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.76,0:32:38.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们干掉它们  血溅满身  再吸进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fire at 'em, get their blood on us, breathe it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.31,0:32:39.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们大老远来这不是为了被感染的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't come all this way to get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.97,0:32:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么知道它们是不是一样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know the ones in there aren't any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.29,0:32:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们不知道  -总得想办法出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't. - Well, it's gotta change sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.11,0:32:54.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.78,0:32:55.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.03,0:33:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.92,0:33:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.60,0:33:36.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该再给他点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should give him a couple more.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.64,0:33:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也许没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.72,0:33:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}He really might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.06,0:33:51.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是已不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.79,0:33:55.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他现在不在这  而我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he's not here... and we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.96,0:34:07.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜了一块好表\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a nice watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.87,0:34:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-退后  -没有出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back. - Don't have an exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.73,0:34:31.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们打一个出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we make one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.67,0:34:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.98,0:34:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快点  快走  -跳到下面的走道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, move it! - Jump down to the walkway below.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.24,0:34:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-它们过来了  -快走  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're here! - Let's go! Go, go. Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.00,0:35:05.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍勃  放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob, let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.78,0:35:07.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管了  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it go, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.17,0:35:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.85,0:35:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别要那个包了  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of the bag, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.54,0:35:29.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的包里没有药\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no meds in your bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.05,0:35:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.96,0:35:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天你应该直接走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have kept walking that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.84,0:35:39.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.24,0:35:59.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吧  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let it go, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.44,0:36:01.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他做出了自己的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man's made his choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.21,0:36:03.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你无法改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing you can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.08,0:36:05.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just gotta let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.50,0:36:09.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想伤害谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to hurt nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.82,0:36:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是为了排解那可怕的寂静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just for when it gets quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.04,0:36:22.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把药拿回去之前  你要胆敢喝一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take one sip. When those meds get in our people,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.95,0:36:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会打得你满地找牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will beat your ass into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.40,0:36:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.70,0:37:01.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也许能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might have lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.20,0:37:07.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯伦和大卫  他们也许能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen and David, they might have lived,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.17,0:37:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.51,0:37:12.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能决定他人生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't your decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.84,0:37:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果泰尔西发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Tyreese finds out...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.12,0:37:19.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.75,0:37:22.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他差点都把我杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He damn near killed me over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.12,0:37:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能应付泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.63,0:37:26.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果其他人知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the others find out,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.57,0:37:28.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会让你留下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they won't want you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.86,0:37:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算他们没能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they don't make it back,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.60,0:37:35.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算大家都因疫病而死  只剩下我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}if everybody dies of this thing and it's just the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.54,0:37:40.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我的孩子  朱迪思和卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Judith and Carl-- with my children...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.67,0:37:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会让你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't have you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.68,0:37:48.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  是我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.09,0:37:53.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人不需要知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else has to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.04,0:37:56.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你不会再替大家做决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were done making decisions for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.59,0:37:59.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这是为了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm making this decision for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.80,0:38:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本可以假装一切都会好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have pretended that everything was gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.24,0:38:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.62,0:38:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出手了  我挺身而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did something. I stepped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.08,0:38:15.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.78,0:38:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.65,0:38:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会留下丽兹和米卡...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think I'm going anywhere without Lizzie and Mica--
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.97,0:38:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想让她们离开  跟你一起走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want them to leave, to go out there with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.56,0:38:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹病了  米卡才十岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie's sick. Mica is 10 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.66,0:38:37.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.42,0:38:40.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会保护她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.91,0:38:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经不再是那个害怕孤独的女人了  不再是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not that woman who was too scared to be alone, not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.22,0:38:53.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以重新开始  找到其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna start over, find others,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.99,0:38:55.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你过去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}people who don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.89,0:38:57.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能在外面生存下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're gonna survive out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.95,0:39:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.61,0:39:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.15,0:39:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来准备走100号高速路\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where I was traveling, Highway 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.24,0:39:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去那里需要花七小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it will take about seven hours to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.44,0:39:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要更多汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need more gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.07,0:39:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们会到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.24,0:39:28.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们走100号高速  -听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Taking Highway 100. - I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.26,0:39:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前的话没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, what you said before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.80,0:39:46.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确找不到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the trail going cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.07,0:39:52.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不用再出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to go out anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.17,0:39:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.96,0:40:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.47,0:40:29.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱德在我们结婚一周年时给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed gave this to me on our first anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.89,0:40:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.72,0:40:44.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就该送人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have given it away a long time ago.
